      "_note": "Behind another car: drag drops by up to maxDragCut and downforce by maxDownforceLoss, fully up to peak m behind, fading out by reach m; the wake is width m wide plus spread m per metre behind; nothing below minSpeed m/s or closer than minGap m.",
